            "notes": "## Power\n\nIn Round 1, you should get either [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) or [Maces to Faces](item_072c4780-53a1-4abd-9fc9-32406c3b7b49). Once we get [Scavenged Steel](item_fb9d2d13-db05-46fa-b3c6-07495b1872a4), [Sk\u00f6ldkastning](item_a6c36dee-d961-428b-b27c-93ba5ef377d8) will be able to trigger multiple times due to its boomerang effect. If you're playing against flyers, you might want to prioritize getting [Maces to Faces](item_072c4780-53a1-4abd-9fc9-32406c3b7b49).\n\n## Items\n\nAs for items, focus on building [Ability Power](stat_ability_power). This will make your powers stronger on top of making your abilities do more damage and healing, which are a huge part of [Brigitte](hero_8d4e7c27-fb70-4694-9721-2ecf094ef84a)'s kit.",
