            "notes": "## Items\n\nIn Round 4, you should get [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8). [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) is an insanely strong item on [Brigitte](hero_8d4e7c27-fb70-4694-9721-2ecf094ef84a), as it gives [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and a crazy amount of survivability. [Brigitte](hero_8d4e7c27-fb70-4694-9721-2ecf094ef84a) is very reliant on her cooldowns and she has so many of them. Each time she uses one of them, [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) will restore 50 armor over 3 seconds. Fill the rest of your slots with cheap items that give [Ability Power](stat_ability_power).",
