            "notes": "## Power\n\nIn Round 5, you can go for either [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0), [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422), [God Ray](item_4abb5cdb-f113-4f21-aa0a-e67d95a11fd0) or [Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8). I go for [Aura Farming](item_b2416f42-1aa6-440a-8080-86290f5556c0) to later synergize with [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee), but if you don't really care for this combination, any of the other powers will do.\n\n## Items\n\nAs we previously established, [Brigitte](hero_8d4e7c27-fb70-4694-9721-2ecf094ef84a) is very reliant on her cooldowns and has a lot of them, so [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) is a great option for its high [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and [Cooldown Reduction](stat_cooldown_reduction). Fill the rest of your slots with cheap items that give [Ability Power](stat_ability_power).",
